    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiply or Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/087af0586c399cab367b8fc16ee9bb62.poster.avif?t=1739272194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/087af0586c399cab367b8fc16ee9bb62.webm?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/087af0586c399cab367b8fc16ee9bb62.mp4?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Cannon Royale is a game about strategy and luck. The goal is to destroy the enemy cannons and be the last survivor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Card based gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4e2fbb951b441418a28a4686ffe6eaca.poster.avif?t=1739272194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4e2fbb951b441418a28a4686ffe6eaca.webm?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4e2fbb951b441418a28a4686ffe6eaca.mp4?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Spin the wheel in order to get cards that will help you throughout the game. Cards can give you extra bullets, shields, multipliers, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pachinko-style Ball Mechanism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4bf228aef50d3d890feab97cda94ef79.poster.avif?t=1739272194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4bf228aef50d3d890feab97cda94ef79.webm?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4bf228aef50d3d890feab97cda94ef79.mp4?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pachinko-style mechanism on the side of each player determines how many bullets to shoot.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Ball lands on x2:</strong> Double your shots </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Ball lands on R:</strong> Release all your shots </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/94b7774d7381c5d937d6cf5248dc5291.poster.avif?t=1739272194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/94b7774d7381c5d937d6cf5248dc5291.webm?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/94b7774d7381c5d937d6cf5248dc5291.mp4?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Customize your cannon with different colors and designs. Customize your territory however you like it by painting in a pixel-art style.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiply or Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/087af0586c399cab367b8fc16ee9bb62.poster.avif?t=1739272194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/087af0586c399cab367b8fc16ee9bb62.webm?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/087af0586c399cab367b8fc16ee9bb62.mp4?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Cannon Royale is a game about strategy and luck. The goal is to destroy the enemy cannons and be the last survivor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Card based gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4e2fbb951b441418a28a4686ffe6eaca.poster.avif?t=1739272194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4e2fbb951b441418a28a4686ffe6eaca.webm?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4e2fbb951b441418a28a4686ffe6eaca.mp4?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Spin the wheel in order to get cards that will help you throughout the game. Cards can give you extra bullets, shields, multipliers, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pachinko-style Ball Mechanism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4bf228aef50d3d890feab97cda94ef79.poster.avif?t=1739272194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4bf228aef50d3d890feab97cda94ef79.webm?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/4bf228aef50d3d890feab97cda94ef79.mp4?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pachinko-style mechanism on the side of each player determines how many bullets to shoot.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Ball lands on x2:</strong> Double your shots </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Ball lands on R:</strong> Release all your shots </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/94b7774d7381c5d937d6cf5248dc5291.poster.avif?t=1739272194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/94b7774d7381c5d937d6cf5248dc5291.webm?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/94b7774d7381c5d937d6cf5248dc5291.mp4?t=1739272194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Customize your cannon with different colors and designs. Customize your territory however you like it by painting in a pixel-art style.</p>",
    "short_description": "Battle against cannons of different colors, using cards that give you extra powers. Play alone or against your friends and win with a strategic use of cards and with luck on your side.",
